- A duplicate schedule entry.
- An unconfirmed schedule change that may need review.

For shifts with known start and end times, compare actual time intervals, including shifts crossing midnight.

Do not flag every pair of shifts on the same date as a confirmed time conflict if their known time intervals do not overlap.

